  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "悾am囡仔ê記持"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"700\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" src=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vRY6F_nTCkLtBFcmBhP_jK9rMTZ9epCmxGj23U2mKXd04GqstOH_8MvItjh8dq23J7-mNy8Q8xuBqny/pub?embedded=true\" width=\"700\"></iframe>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b></b></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgu09nNVKFo4IzmwyfjV2oRLPNRhQNc7wNsVEVivu4RxTPX6Oi0_2rhfIr2yqWcX8vnS168nF0XoY0ufObLjRl-eT3t6CDs-awNnmSSfqB9UuhSFlIRL9M9V-PdsmUtnSLzxrT6NOQzYvCEjQ45zRHkeZypujmhaxXMEqBSurDVtgaI3h-PjUZ23M7B1A/s657/%E9%98%BFK%E8%B3%9E%E5%BE%BD%E7%AB%A0_%E9%BB%83%E9%87%91.jpg\" style=\"clear: left; float: left; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"657\" data-original-width=\"457\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgu09nNVKFo4IzmwyfjV2oRLPNRhQNc7wNsVEVivu4RxTPX6Oi0_2rhfIr2yqWcX8vnS168nF0XoY0ufObLjRl-eT3t6CDs-awNnmSSfqB9UuhSFlIRL9M9V-PdsmUtnSLzxrT6NOQzYvCEjQ45zRHkeZypujmhaxXMEqBSurDVtgaI3h-PjUZ23M7B1A/s320/%E9%98%BFK%E8%B3%9E%E5%BE%BD%E7%AB%A0_%E9%BB%83%E9%87%91.jpg\" width=\"223\" /></a></div>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>王崇憲</b></span></b></span></div><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">記持kám ē tuè時間大漢？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">記持，應該ē像春天ê花芳，熱天ê西北雨，siuh--一-下就無--去--ah；記持，應該mā ē像風颱天做大水，若是淹到壁堵，就ē留一條水痕，一直tiâu tī hia……。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Ē記得hit一工，做伙sńg ê囡仔伴講：「Lán來比看啥人khah有膽、速度khah緊，án-ne就ē-tàng做老大--ê！」我一聲mā應「好！」阮就走去大馬路邊，mā m̄管有車--無，囡仔伴一下就衝過去對面，koh tī hia激小丑仔面，假鬼假怪！我看--著了後，就用規身軀ê gōng力，想beh一步就衝到對面！我tsông到半路niâ，隨看著一台oo-tóo-bái，輪仔tuì我tsia直直衝--過-來，to iáu bē赴出聲--leh，就去hōo挵--著--ah！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tī昏昏沉沉茫茫渺渺當中，我知影有人leh挲我ê面，mā kánn-ná聽著有人leh háu講：「醫生啊，你一定ài救阮囝--lah，我kā你拜託--lah！」He聲音一下仔遠、一下仔近，含含糊糊，ná有ná無……到尾--à，聲音親像la-jí-ooh ê開關去hōo人tsūn kah愈來愈細聲、愈來愈細聲……。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">記持bē tuè時間大漢，伊ē暫時停止！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">M̄知影時間過偌久，mā m̄知影阿母tī我身邊等偌久--ah？我目睭一thí--開，就看著伊一直leh流目屎……。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">「醫生啊，khah緊--leh！Khah緊來--leh！阮囝精神--ah！」伊ná háu，ná叫醫生ài緊救--我……。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Hit種háu，我到tsit-má koh ē記--得——一種傷心kah無tè tháu ê哭聲，m̄知是自責iah是m̄甘，或者是——兩種lóng有？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Suà--落-來ê日子，阿母每工lóng煮魚仔湯來hōo我食，mā無去做khang-khuè--ah，逐工就tī病院leh照顧--我。好佳哉，我只是頭去kho̍k著塗跤，thīnn十外針，小可仔腦震盪，歇睏一禮拜就出院--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我便若摸著頭殼頂hit tsuā疤，就ē想起家己真正是悾am兼giàn頭，做代誌無leh用頭腦，tsiah ē去舞tsit齣--ê，m̄-nā hōo阿母傷心煩惱，koh家己討皮疼。阿母hit工悲傷ê哭聲、流bē離ê目屎，親像做大水仝款，淹來tīnn到我ê心肝頭，mā tī我ê心內深深刻一巡「愛ê記號」，我永遠lóng bē去kā放bē記--得！&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><!--more--><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjv3qTgbEKjF9qkFVKzQJEi8ZANppXciIvARkPzamggVEqYMYLSGDuscB6u-65ak_I8GpaUsmI_D04XrDM6iJ4tj6u_fRmmB3InAW0-QbEw8IfJDojGJaHUXWXIaupC6KPj-Xi4Y6l5euMEI2WeJ6zW2U5TssPRegm0Py8Fz-0z2mUs_R2vkUJ4wYP9XA/s4032/%E7%8E%8B%E5%B4%87%E6%86%B2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3024\" data-original-width=\"4032\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjv3qTgbEKjF9qkFVKzQJEi8ZANppXciIvARkPzamggVEqYMYLSGDuscB6u-65ak_I8GpaUsmI_D04XrDM6iJ4tj6u_fRmmB3InAW0-QbEw8IfJDojGJaHUXWXIaupC6KPj-Xi4Y6l5euMEI2WeJ6zW2U5TssPRegm0Py8Fz-0z2mUs_R2vkUJ4wYP9XA/w640-h480/%E7%8E%8B%E5%B4%87%E6%86%B2.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\">倒手爿--ê是作者王崇憲</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_vgYrk4hW-sy8lf_5007WQ2siEEHHQ-foS1E7yvfJKkirMC65Z5fzUrVV8MZeP7zzCt4Z9HTCRAvUNg9b8YhdCrfb-DQtLigzgbskNb4RX-s2gWOWqG8Lsg3ZlnKrEgXgXlwx5ec7HJujVca-CSxF1tpZ-JdSCgYyVhWG-vtyNpFz9FIdFS_qIemDTg/s1424/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-origi